  "description_en": "Changes the image of a cloud phone matrix instance. Image changes are supported only for instances in the running, stopped, or image change failed state. The GPU vendor of the destination image must match the GPU vendor of the server where the current instance resides. If you change the image across versions, such as upgrading from Android 10 to Android 12, the system forcibly clears all data, which is equivalent to changing the image and resetting the instance",
